1
00:10:09,230 --> 00:10:15,230
Monsters of Man is a science fiction, action film directed by Mark Toia.

2
00:20:18,461 --> 00:20:24,461
A robotics company vying to win a lucrative military contract team up with
a corrupt CIA agent to conduct an illegal live field test.

3
00:30:27,692 --> 00:30:33,692
They deploy four weaponized prototype robots into a suspected drug manufacturing camp in the
Golden Triangle, assuming they'd be killing drug runners that no one would miss.

4
00:40:36,923 --> 00:40:42,923
Six doctors on a humanitarian mission witness the
brutal slaughter and become prime targets.

5
00:50:46,153 --> 00:50:52,153
Major, played by Neal McDonough.

